              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akidho neno nike teko opodho kwoŋ jo ma kibero. Ji je ma Yuda ma jobedo i piny Misir jolarere g'abor kodi kec m'ongoye ŋata ladoŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jono ma joboth abor joladok wok i piny Misir kidho i piny Yuda, manok i welo, aka ji ma jodoŋ i Yuda ma jobino bedo i piny Misir jolaŋeyo nike wac pa ŋa maloyo, aparan kosa apajo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me labedo ranyuth riwin, Rwoth waco, nike akidho miyo win gir'acula i kabedo me, ŋey winyal ŋeyo nike wac paran riwin latundo i kare adieri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.29"
            ]
