                  "text": "2 Kerin 25:1-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth waco ama, akidho ketho Farawo Hofira, kere ma Misir, i cingi jokwor pere, jono ma jodwaro neko go, paka aketho kere Zedekia ma Yuda i cingi kere Nebukadineza ma Babilon, jakwor pere m'odwaro neko go.”",
          "type": "text",
